; Import-library definition for USBPORT.SYS.
;
; Plain (undecorated) export names: link resolves each to the _Name@N
; stdcall symbol in usbport-stub.obj and exports it undecorated, matching
; the real USBPORT.SYS export table.
;
; The shipping binaries export three names at ordinals 1-3 - DllUnload,
; USBPORT_GetHciMn, USBPORT_RegisterUSBPortDriver - identically on all three
; lineages (NUSB 5.00.2195.5652, Win2000 SP4 5.00.2195.6681, XP SP3
; 5.1.2600.5512). DllUnload is not part of the miniport contract and no
; shipping miniport imports it, so it is deliberately omitted here: the
; import gate (roadmap Phase 3 task 5) allowlists only what this file names.
;
; make-usbport-lib.cmd checks this list exactly against the tracked
; usbport-imports.expected manifest before every build. When a reference
; binary is supplied, its export table must contain both exact names too.

LIBRARY USBPORT.SYS
EXPORTS
    USBPORT_GetHciMn
    USBPORT_RegisterUSBPortDriver
